    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA McGee are delighted to present an exceptional opportunity to acquire a superbly located two-bedroom apartment in the heart of Dublin 8, one of the city’s most vibrant and sought-after residential areas. Apartment 4, Earlsfield Court offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation with a practical layout, ideal for both owner-occupiers and investors.The accommodation comprises an entrance hallway with storage, leading to a bright and spacious open-plan living and dining area with large windows allowing for excellent natural light.The separate kitchen is fitted with a range of wall and floor units, providing ample storage and workspace, along with freestanding appliances.There are two generously proportioned double bedrooms, both benefiting from built-in wardrobes.The main bathroom is fully tiled and comprises a WC, wash hand basin, and a corner shower unit.\r\nSituated on Francis Street in the heart of The Liberties, this location offers an unbeatable mix of culture, convenience, and connectivity. A wide range of cafés, restaurants, shops, and cultural attractions are right on your doorstep, while the city centre is within easy walking distance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prime Dublin 8 city centre apartment\r\nCar parking space \r\nSecure, well-managed development\r\nStrong rental investment potential\r\nWalking distance to Christchurch, St. Stephen’s Green & Grafton Street\r\nExcellent transport links (bus routes & LUAS nearby)\r\nManagement Fee: Approx €1,770"
      },
